      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Management believes that the information on this page has been prepared in accordance with the Commission's Opinion 154-B methodology. This presentation on page 700 is not necessarily in the form in which it would appear in connection with a challenge to a particular rate, or rates, and is therefore not intended to be binding in any specific rate litigation.</p>
        <p>Notes:</p>
        <p>Pursuant to the Commission&#8217;s Remedial Order, issued on November 20, 2025, in Docket No. RM25-2-000, Total Interstate Operating Revenues include amounts recoverable during the Locked-In-Period from March 1, 2022, to September 17, 2024.</p>
        <p>2024 amounts have been restated to correct the rate base calculation.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH0AE0AB48EC65784DEE0D7489FF3C5B05" xlink:to="HH35DF24BF915BDAF17FBF243C926D7F0D" order="1" />
  </link:footnoteLink>
